{"sourceUrl":"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/info/1017/1901.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:41.466200+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/info/1017/1901.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span>根据教育部研究生招生工作有关规定</span></span><span><span>以及中国社会科学院大学《</span></span><span><span>中国社会科学院大学</span></span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读研究生招生工作办法</span></span><span><span>》相关规定</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>结合外国语学院具体情况，现就我院</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读研究生（以下简称推免生）工作的相关事宜通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、</span></span><strong><span><span>接收专业、计划</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>中国社会科学院大学外国语学院</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年拟接收优秀应届本科生免试攻读硕士学术学位研究生</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>人；拟接收</span></span><span><span>优秀应届本科生</span></span><span><span>免试攻读博士学位研究生（直博生）</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>人。</span></span><span><span>其中英语语言文学专业招收</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>名推免生，</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>名直博生，法语语言文学招收</span><span>1名推免生，俄语语言文学招收</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>名推免生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>各专业实际接收人数将根据生源情况进行调整，如未完成推免接收计划，剩余名额将用于统考招生。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、申请条件和要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）申请推荐免试硕士生</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>. </span></span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>. </span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>. </span></span><span><span>获得所在高校当年正式推免资格，并在教育部</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”完成注册；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>. </span></span><span><span>身体健康状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>. </span></span><span><span>学习成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>. </span></span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果及任何违法违纪受处分记录</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）申请直博生</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>直博生是指从优秀的具备推荐免试研究生资格的应届本科毕业生（简称推免生）中选拔出来直接攻读博士学位的研究生。直博生学习年限不低于五年。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>除须满足上述（一）中各项条件外，还应达到如下条件：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span>申请者须学习成绩优秀，专业学业成绩名列本专业或年段前茅，一般应在前</span></span><span><span>20%</span></span><span><span>以内。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span>申请者具有较高的外语水平</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>专业外语四级以上</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、申请程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院学术型硕士研究生</span></span><span><span>自本实施细则发布之时起即可开始预报名，预报名截止时间为</span></span><strong><span><span>9月15日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>12</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>:00</span></span></strong><span><span>，以我院邮箱（</span></span><span>panchen</span><span>@cass.org.cn</span><span><span>）收到邮件的时间为最终报名时间，提交申请材料者即表示进行预报名申请。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（一）提交申请材料</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>申请人将电子版申请材料按顺序汇总为一个</span></span><span>pdf</span><span><span>文档，以</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>-姓名-</span></span><span><span>学硕</span></span><span><span>推免</span></span><span><span>报考专业</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>或</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span>-直博生”</span></span><span><span>命名，于</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><strong><span><span>9</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>15</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日（周</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>中午</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>12:00</span></span></strong><span><span>之前发送到邮箱</span></span><a href=\"mailto:panchen@cass.org.cn。\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>panchen</span></span><span><span>@cass.org.cn</span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></a></p>\n<p><span><span>如因特殊原因无法及时提交材料应联系学院并说明情况。注意留存材料纸质原件或证书复印件，根据学院后续通知提交纸质版。</span></span><span><span>对不符合规定或弄虚作假者，一经查实，取消资格。材料清单如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span>《中国社会科学院大学</span></span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）学位研究生申请表》（须加盖推荐高校教务管理部门公章</span></span><span><span>，</span><span>“外语语种及水平”一栏除填写第一外国语语种信息外，还须注明第二外国语语种信息</span></span><span><span>）（附件</span></span><span><span>1</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span>有效期内的身份证、每学期均注册的学生证复印件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3. </span></span><span><span>本科阶段历年学习成绩单和排名证明（须加盖推荐高校教务处公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4. </span></span><span><span>提交国家英语</span></span><span><span>专业四级</span></span><span><span>考试成绩单，或其他外语水平证明材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5. </span></span><span><span>公开发表的论文、著（译）作，如无公开发表的科研成果，可提供</span><span>2篇能够体现自身学术水平、科研能力的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等其它材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6. </span></span><span><span>获奖证书</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7. </span></span><span><span>个人简历等自我评价材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>8. </span></span><span><span>申请攻读研究生报告（材料自拟）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>9. </span></span><span><span>报考研究生人员思想政治素质和品德考核表（附件</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>10. </span></span><span><span>申请</span></span><span><span>直博生还须提供两位报考专业所在</span></span><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>级学科领域内教授或相当职称专家出具的推荐信</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>附件</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>11. </span></span><span><span>中国社会科学院大学</span><span>2026年研究生招生考试复试考生诚信承诺书</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>附件</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>以上材</span></span><span><span>料</span></span><span><span>如有特殊情况无法及时加盖公章的</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>应在提交材</span></span><span><span>料</span></span><span><span>中写明原因</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>并及时完善</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（二）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>材</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>料</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>审核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院成立材</span></span><span><span>料</span></span><span><span>审核专家组</span></span><span><span>，对</span></span><span><span>推免生提交的申请材</span></span><span><span>料</span></span><span><span>进行审核并</span></span><span><span>择</span></span><span><span>优确定复试考生</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>复试名单将于</span></span><strong><span>9<span>月</span><span>16</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日（周三）</span></span></strong><span><span>在中国</span></span><span><span>外国文学</span></span><span><span>网</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>中国社会科学院</span></span><span><span>大</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>外国语学</span></span><span><span>院网站公</span></span><span><span>布。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（三）教育部推免服务系统</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span> </span><span><span>教育部</span><span>“全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址:</span></span><span><span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span><span><span>）为推免工作统一的信息备案公开平台和网上报考录取系统。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span> </span><span><span>申请人应</span></span><span><span>在规定时间内</span></span><span><span>，登录推免服务系统，在系统中注册和填写基本信息，完成网上报名、网上缴费、接受复试确认和待录取确认等环节。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>综合考核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院将成立综合考核小组，</span></span><span><span>采取网络远程复试方式进行，复试拟使用腾讯会议软件，具体安排另行通知。请申请人及时接听电话。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试时间：</span></span><strong><span><span>2026</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>17</span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>(</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>周</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>四</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>)</span></span></strong><span><span>，具体时间另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、复试考核办法</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学术型硕士复试为综合面试，</span></span><span><span>包括专业面试、外语听力和口试、综合素质面试。复试总分</span></span><span>300</span><span><span>分，合格线为</span></span><span><span>180</span></span><span><span>分。具体包括专业素质和能力总分</span></span><span><span>150</span></span><span><span>分，合格线</span></span><span><span>90</span></span><span><span>分；综合素质和能力（包括外语听力和口试</span></span><span><span>50</span></span><span><span>分）总分</span></span><span><span>150</span></span><span><span>分，合格线</span></span><span><span>90</span></span><span><span>分。复试</span></span><span><span>将</span></span><span><span>对推免生的学习能力、科研能力、创新精神、工作能力、思想品德等诸方面进行全面考核，重点</span></span><span><span>考查</span></span><span><span>学生科研创新潜力，对学科的认识、学科知识的综合应用能力，考生知识结构及背景等。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>体检</span> </span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>被</span></span><span><span>我院拟录取的推免生应在</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>级甲等及以上医院或专业体检机构自行完成体检</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>并于</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>日前将体检表</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>附件</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>原件邮寄至我院</span></span><span><span>。（</span></span><span><span>邮寄地址同</span></span><span><span>外国语学院</span></span><span><span>联系地址</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>七</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、接收原则及要</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>求</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>在申请人数充足的情况下</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>综合考核实行差额复试</span></span><span><span>，择</span></span><span><span>优录取</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>具体差额比例根据专业自身特点和生源情况确定</span></span><span><span>。预推免名单公示后不再增加其他推免生名额。</span></span><span><span>推免生应在我院规定的时间内确认是否接受我校发送的待录取通知</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>逾期</span></span><span><span>未</span></span><span><span>确认者视为放弃</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>考生接受待录取通知应慎重</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>诚实守信</span></span><span><span>，一</span></span><span><span>经自主选</span></span><span><span>择</span></span><span><span>并被确定为待录取</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>不得提出放弃</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>待录取名单需经学校审定并进行公示</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>有以下情况之</span></span><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>者</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>不予录取</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span>未</span></span><span><span>经我院复试的申请者</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span>未</span></span><span><span>经</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>全国推免服务系统</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>报名的申请者</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3. </span></span><span><span>对</span></span><span><span>在推免过程中弄虚作假</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>有论文</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>文章</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>抄袭</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>虚报获奖或科研成果等学</span></span><span><span>术</span></span><span><span>不端行为的</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>或因各种原因受到</span></span><span><span>本</span></span><span><span>科所在高校处分的学生</span></span><span><span>，一</span></span><span><span>经查实</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>即取消其录取资格</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4. </span></span><span><span>已经被录取的推免生</span></span><span><span>必</span></span><span><span>须在录取当年新生入学前取得国家承认的</span></span><span><span>本</span></span><span><span>科毕业证书</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>否则取消其录取资格</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5. </span></span><span><span>未</span></span><span><span>按接收录取要求在我院规定时间内完成全国推免系统待录取确认的</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>八、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>特别说明</span> </span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院推免生招生工作严格按照教育部</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>北京市及学校文件规定</span></span><span><span>执</span></span><span><span>行</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>如上级主管部</span></span><span><span>门</span></span><span><span>出台新的研究生招生政策或指导性工作要求等</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>我院将</span></span><span><span>对</span></span><span><span>实施细则做相应调整</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>九</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>北京市东城区建国门内大街</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>号，中国社会科学院外国文学研究所，联系人：</span></span><span><span>潘</span></span><span><span>老师，联系电话：</span></span><span><span>010-8519558</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>                                <span>中国社会科学院大学外国语学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>                              <span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p> <span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1541925987&amp;wbfileid=16657848\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：中国社会科学院大学2027年接收推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）学位申请表.doc</a><br/></span></p>\n<p>  <span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1541925987&amp;wbfileid=16657862\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：报考研究生人员思想政治素质和品德考核表.docx</a></span></p>\n<p> <span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1541925987&amp;wbfileid=16657847\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3：专家推荐书.doc</a></span> <br/></p>\n<p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1541925987&amp;wbfileid=16657850\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件4：中国社会科学院大学2027年研究生招生考试复试考生诚信承诺书.docx</a><br/></span></p>\n<p> <span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1541925987&amp;wbfileid=16657851\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件5：中国社会科学院大学研究生招生体格检查表.doc</a></span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"ac574964cc757d1b20b1046d242478067a6acea6cab71cc905be7566af7fd513","textLength":2758,"sourceSha256":"5e9620b317ac161c4708ada229681ea460627f14b61b5f8025091b18c88b6669","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2c074b5aafad13175c38","title":"2026年中国社会科学院大学外国语学院2027年接收推荐免试攻读学术型硕士研究生复试实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:41.466200+00:00"}
